  <!-- EN: Automatic Revolver Electromagnetic Slingshot -->
  <DMS_Chameleon_UpgradeTree.nodes.0.label>A.R.E.S.</DMS_Chameleon_UpgradeTree.nodes.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Automatic Revolver Electromagnetic Slingshot(A.R.E.S.) A lightweight 76mm anti-tank revolver cannon with an independent fire control system. the use of electromagnetic acceleration makes projectile capable to penetrate any heavy armored vehicles. \n\n Interestingly, this weapon is also one of the few non-gunpowder weapon systems known to have entered the mass production stage and been put into use by the colonial fleet. -->
  <DMS_Chameleon_UpgradeTree.nodes.0.description>自动转轮电磁弹弓(A.R.E.S.)一种轻型76mm反坦克转轮炮，具有独立的火控系统。利用电磁加速使射弹能够击穿任何重型装甲车辆。\n\n有趣的是，这种武器也是为数不多的已进入大规模生产阶段并被殖民舰队投入使用的非火药武器系统之一。</DMS_Chameleon_UpgradeTree.nodes.0.description>
